+ * wlr_compositor only uploads on the next commit, so idle surfaces would stay
+ * invisible. Ask clients to repaint:
+ *  - damage + schedule a frame on every output, so the frame handler runs and
+ *    sends frame_done to every visible surface (unblocks clients waiting on a
+ *    frame callback);
+ *  - send a configure (same state) to xdg toplevels and layer surfaces with
+ *    no configure in flight: the client must ack and commit, and toolkits
+ *    redraw on configure. This needs no geometry change and does not touch
+ *    the layout code.
+ * Xwayland windows are only covered by Xwayland's own repaint on damage.
+ * Cursor textures are dropped too, so re-apply the cursor image.
